# Shape Morphing — Reproduce a Circle→Square→Diamond Animation in Revideo

> The agent must reverse-engineer a 20-second reference video (`reference.mp4`) showing 4 colored shapes morphing through circle→square→diamond phases, and reproduce it algorithmically as a Revideo scene in `src/project.tsx`. The core challenge is deriving the parametric morph geometry and phase timing from visual inspection alone, using Revideo's TypeScript/React scene graph — not hardcoded per-frame data.

---

## Task Configuration

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Difficulty | Hard |
| Category | Animation |
| Agent Timeout | 2 hours (7200s) |
| Verifier Timeout | 20 minutes (1200s) |
| Internet Access | Enabled (waivered — see Notes) |
| CPUs / Memory | 8 CPUs / 32 GB |

